{% section-card %}
## Use current primary references

- [OpenTelemetry signals](https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/): current definitions for traces, metrics, logs, and context propagation.
- [Prometheus alerting rules](https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/): rule state, persistence, labels, annotations, and Alertmanager handoff.
- [Google SRE monitoring guidance](https://sre.google/workbook/monitoring/): connecting user-impact signals to diagnostic telemetry.
- [MLflow Model Registry workflows](https://mlflow.org/docs/latest/ml/model-registry/workflow): current model aliases, tags, and version retrieval patterns.
- [Grafana](/technology/grafana), [Prometheus](/technology/prometheus), [MLflow](/technology/mlflow), and [Apache Kafka](/technology/kafka) show implementation building blocks used by many monitoring stacks.

Products and managed monitoring features evolve. Recheck vendor documentation before adopting a service-specific capability or lifecycle policy.
{% /section-card %}

